    "id": "h56ez-ota-architecture-redrawn",
    "title": "H56EZ OTA Architecture",
    "subtitle": "Android orchestration, QNX flash tools, shared firmware staging and MCU transport",
    "description": "Layered OTA architecture derived from the H56EZ design document. Android and QNX exchange commands through ZeroMQ REQ/REP and firmware files through one shared eMMC partition. QNX invokes partition, MCU and peripheral flash tools. MCU commands and firmware chunks travel through rpcd over SPI. The diagram distinguishes firmware transfer, control, interface dependency and bank activation.",
    "scope": "system", "view": "layered", "colorMode": "technical"
  },
